e="decimal" min="0" step="1" value="1"/><button type="button" aria-label="Augmenter">+</button></span><span class="cl-total num">= 0 €</span></div><div class="clr"><span class="cl-lk">🔗</span><input class="cl-note" placeholder="Note ou lien matériau (https://…)" value=""/><label class="cl-tvalab">TVA <select><option value="5.5">5,5 %</option><option value="10" selected="">10 %</option><option value="20">20 %</option></select></label><button type="button" class="cl-info" title="Guide TVA">i</button></div><div class="clr cl-actions"><button type="button" class="cl-valider" disabled="">✓ Valider la tâche</button><button type="button" class="cl-cancel">Annuler</button></div></div><button type="button" class="cl-add">＋ Ajouter une ligne personnalisée</button></div>"`;

